-- Link Fantrax ids onto UNIFIED_PLAYER_TABLE rows that carry none.
--
-- Generated 2026-09-23 from Fantrax's official Beta API (getPlayerIds), matched
-- by name against every name column of UNIFIED_PLAYER_TABLE. FANTRAX_ID was populated once by
-- hand and never since: of the players on an NBA roster today a third carry no id, so a live
-- Fantrax draft resolves them to the replacement-level player. Names are matched with
-- generational suffixes stripped, which is what dropped e.g. "Trey Murphy III" against
-- Fantrax's "Murphy, Trey".
--
-- 129 links. Ambiguous names (0) and players with no row at all
-- (40) are excluded -- the latter need new rows, not a link.
--
-- Every statement re-checks FANTRAX_ID IS NULL, so a link made by hand between generating
-- this file and running it is never overwritten.

BEGIN;

